[b]Verification[/b]
64 isolated runtime/UI checks and 64 compatibility checks with 11 other plugins passed on the released DLL. The archive passed clean extraction and hash verification.

Generative AI was used for code, documentation and promotional thumbnail artwork. The gallery gameplay screenshot shows the running mod.
